# What export/export-public.sh exports: git pathspecs, ! excludes.
# The runs: the newest golden set of each family; earlier sets and the
# narrower runs (-rN) stay here. Windows set 1 predates the runner account
# (host paths) and has two runs that are not DCs: set 2 replaces it.
runs/almalinux-*-g1/**
runs/ubuntu-*-g1/**
runs/fedora-*-g1/**
runs/win*-g2/**
README.md
# Not the egress group file: from egress data to groups is firru 2.0, held for now.
# The pipeline.
pipeline/win/**
pipeline/linux/**
pipeline/osquery/**
pipeline/asa/**
pipeline/scan.sh
pipeline/sweep.sh
bin/run-list.sh
bin/run-one.sh
sets/golden-*.jobs
analysis/layers.yml
analysis/fw-baseline.py
export/public.list
!pipeline/win/*.draft
